{
  "slug": "windows-desktop-com-plugin-for-mail",
  "name": "Windows Desktop Com Plugin For Mail",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Cowork connector for Microsoft Outlook desktop. Read, triage, draft, send, and schedule — all via local COM. No Azure AD, no IT approvals, no cloud credentials.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install windows-desktop-com-plugin-for-mail@claude-community` from `gabrieldenny-del/outlook-extension`.\n\nA shareable Claude Code / Cowork plugin that lets Claude drive the locally-installed Microsoft Outlook desktop client via COM. No Azure AD registration, no OAuth, no cloud. Works against whatever accounts your Outlook profile already has.",
